510
00:46:23.864 --> 00:46:24.698
umiiyak ka ba

511
00:46:25.783 --> 00:46:27.034
Takot ka na ba?

512
00:46:36.627 --> 00:46:39.963
<i>At para maiwasan ang biglaang pagkabalisa,</i>
<i>iyon ay gumagapang muli...</i>

513
00:46:56.772 --> 00:46:57.940
Gomme.

514
00:47:03.278 --> 00:47:04.488
Hindi ka nag-iisa.

515
00:47:06.323 --> 00:47:09.660
<i>...sapat na</i>
<i>sandali lang o ilang</i>

516
00:47:09.743 --> 00:47:10.661
<i>mga simpleng salita.</i>

517
00:47:28.595 --> 00:47:30.180
